	\L_07704:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　　Zeth'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'　Amber - Kabachahn’s Estate'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... It’s in your hands,'
	R
	'General Kabachahn. You and the'
	R
	'others have to be the Four'
	R
	'Lords’ shield.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Chizuko stated coldly and'
	R
	'stood up from her chair in the'
	R
	'parlor. Kabachahn took it'
	R
	'calmly.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Indeed.'
	R
	'If it’s for the country, it'
	R
	'would be our pleasure to obey.'
	R
	'...Hm? A visitor?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	!VAR0516 : 456!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'You here, old man...? Ah.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh, General Saias.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Saias came through the door'
	R
	'Chizuko was about to open.'
	R
	'The unexpected encounter'
	R
	'raised the room’s tension.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'If it isn’t Lord Chizuko?'
	R
	'Came down from your tower to'
	R
	'give your advice to the people'
	R
	'actually fighting?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	!VAR0516 : 458!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Watch it, Saias...'
	R
	'Lord Chizuko, I’ll be sortying'
	R
	'shortly, so you may leave.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	!VAR0516 : 456!
	\L_07790:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'But Chizuko and Saias ignored'
	R
	'Kabachahn’s mediation.'
	R
	'They looked at each other with'
	R
	'sardonic smiles.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, because you four are so'
	R
	'worthless. And what are you'
	R
	'doing here? Maybe you should'
	R
	'go fight with the others...'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'Surely you didn’t come to play'
	R
	'in such a time of crisis.'
	R
	'The Four Generals are known'
	R
	'for being close, though.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	!VAR0516 : 458!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Lord Chizuko, Saias...!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	!VAR0516 : 456!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes, well... Trusting each'
	R
	'other is an important part of'
	R
	'our job. Seems like the Four'
	R
	'Lords have trouble there.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s none of your business.'
	R
	'How am I supposed to get along'
	R
	'with them!? Speaking of which,'
	R
	'the same with you four!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'If I may say so, the way I see'
	R
	'it, it’s you four that are the'
	R
	'problem!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	!VAR0516 : 458!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Mgh... Mmmmmgh...'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'Sileeeeeeeeeeeeeeeence!!!'
	R
	'Can you two be quiet?!!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Kabachahn yelled so loud he'
	R
	'shook the house.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Saias, how could you greet a'
	R
	'superior so aggressively?!!'
	R
	'Have you no manners?!!'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'Lord Chizuko, realize you’re'
	R
	'taking the King’s place in'
	R
	'leading the country!'
	R
	'Ignore this fool’s sarcasm!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Agh, my ears are'
	R
	'ringing...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0772e:
	!VAR0516 : 456!
	\L_07720:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'B-But, old man...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Are you incapable of'
	R
	'listening?!! I’m sortying, you'
	R
	'two get out of my house at'
	R
	'once!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Kabachahn stomped out of the'
	R
	'room.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah...'
	R
	'He’s exactly like thunder.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	!VAR0516 : 254!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'Mr. Playboy, did you make'
	R
	'Grampa mad?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Futaba!!'
	R
	'Who are you calling a'
	R
	'playboy?!!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0772e:
	!VAR0516 : 43!
	\L_07720:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Ppth, heheh...'
	R
	'That’s a good name for you,'
	R
	'General Saias.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Moe）'
	R
	'Ah, Gawdy Girl.'
	R
	'You’re here?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'What did you call meeeeeee?!!!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	!VAR0516 : 0!
