	\L_07790:
	\L_07704:
	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　Kabachahn’s Estate'
	\L_077f1:
	ZM 24:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Is nobody in this house...?'
	R
	'Seems like there should be'
	R
	'some kind of treasure.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Heheh, should be a good'
	R
	'achievement for us.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'A number of soldiers had their'
	R
	'eyes on Kabachahn’s estate,'
	R
	'now without its owner.'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'The old-fashioned house was'
	R
	'damaged all over from fighting,'
	R
	'but much of it still looked'
	R
	'fine.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Lucky us, nobody’s here...'
	R
	'Time for the Leazas Army to'
	R
	'make a levy.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'The soldiers quietly opened'
	R
	'the door. A long, dark hall'
	R
	'extended out in front of them.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, excuse us...'
	R
	'King’s orders, so we’ll be'
	R
	'collecting all your valuables.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'The soldiers stepped into the'
	R
	'hall.'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'　　＜vrrrrrrrrrrrrr＞'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Huh...?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'What’s that sound!?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Dwaaaah!!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0772e:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Oh... Wah... Marbles!?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'The soldiers fell over onto'
	R
	'the river of marbles that'
	R
	'suddenly flowed through the'
	R
	'hall.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	!VAR0516 : 261!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Wha...?'
	R
	'What, guerrillas!?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	!VAR0516 : 254!
	\L_07720:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'...........'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Moe）'
	R
	'............'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Ah... Wah...'
	R
	'Children... Ghosts? Phantoms!?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Futaba and Moe appeared'
	R
	'further up the hall.'
	R
	'They glared sadly at the'
	R
	'Leazas soldiers.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'Dummiiiiiiiiiiiiies!'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Moe）'
	R
	'Hick...'
	R
	'I hate you, soldiers...!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Hii, hweh...!?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0772e:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'They left the bewildered'
	R
	'soldiers, turned around and'
	R
	'ran away.'
	\L_077f1:
	{VAR0723 \ 2:
		ZH 1:
		'After that,'
		R
		'nobody saw them again...'
		\L_077f1:
		\L_077e4:
		!VAR0516 : 0!
		%#M.ADV:
		%0:
	}
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'What was that...?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0779e:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'.........'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'......'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	!VAR0516 : 254!
	\L_07720:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'Haah, haah, haah...'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Moe）'
	R
	'Now what do we do, Futaba...?'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'I... I dunno!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'...Found you.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'Huh...?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	!VAR0516 : 457!
	\L_07790:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Futaba, Moe, I was looking for'
	R
	'you two...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Moe）'
	R
	'Uspira...'
	R
	'Hweh... Waaaaaaaaaaah...!'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'Waaaaaaaah, Uspiraaa...!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Futaba and Moe clung to Uspira,'
	R
	'and she gently hugged them'
	R
	'back.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07758:
	ZH 1:
	'We’re so alike...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s go, you two...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Futaba）'
	R
	'O-Okay...!'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'　　（Moe）'
	R
	'Yes...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Then the three of them went'
	R
	'off somewhere...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
