	ZM 32:
	ZH 1:
	'　　　　Zeth'
	R
	ZM 24:
	ZH 1:
	R
	'Old Zeth - Alex’s Estate'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'The courtyard was filled with'
	R
	'light. Alex placed his emptied'
	R
	'teacup on the sun-covered'
	R
	'table.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Haah...'
	R
	'Have to go now.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'He sighed as he so seldom did'
	R
	'and stood up from his chair.'
	R
	'A refreshing wind blew through'
	R
	'the large garden.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076e8:
	ZH 1:
	'We’d be so much better off'
	R
	'without war, though...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Alex... Are you leaving to'
	R
	'fight?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'A hedge rustled and Magic'
	R
	'appeared.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	!VAR0516 : 58!
	\L_07790:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Magic...!'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Heheh, I came.'
	R
	'I wonder if the magic'
	R
	'commanders are mad.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course they’d be mad about'
	R
	'one of the Four Lords leaving'
	R
	'her tower during a crisis.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'But I wanted to see you.'
	R
	'We haven’t really been able to'
	R
	'meet since the war started.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'I did too... But we can’t meet,'
	R
	'Magic... It’s dangerous.'
	R
	'You’re worrying me.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Really? Huhu...'
	R
	'You’re the only one who’d'
	R
	'worry about me, Alex.'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'Wichita would even act as my'
	R
	'bodyguard, but I’m stronger'
	R
	'than her... Not that I even'
	R
	'need magic power for anything.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Don’t you need it to inherit'
	R
	'the throne?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm...'
	R
	'I wish I was born to a more'
	R
	'normal family.'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'Where I had siblings, and a'
	R
	'mom and dad that were always'
	R
	'home...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Magic...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Alex gently hugged Magic.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'We might have never met if'
	R
	'that were true. We met because'
	R
	'you were enrolled at the magic'
	R
	'academy.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'That’s true...'
	R
	'Maybe I need magic after all,'
	R
	'then...'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'............'
	\L_077f1:
	ZH 1:
	'...Hey, Alex?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Let’s go somewhere...'
	R
	'Far away from Zeth.'
	R
	'Together.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Again with this...?'
	R
	'No, you’d make His Majesty sad.'
	R
	'I want to gain everyone’s'
	R
	'approval and make you happy.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Hm...'
	R
	'Yeah... Sure...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Well... I have to go.'
	R
	'Time to sortie.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Alex patted Magic on the head'
	R
	'and left the garden.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0772e:
	\L_07758:
	ZH 1:
	'Alex... You dummy.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
