	R
	'Uspira was visiting.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Sorry I have to deploy as soon'
	R
	'as you get here.'
	R
	'You can relax here.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... It’s not you that'
	R
	'decided to sortie, we’re'
	R
