	'You don’t have to apologize.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Yeah...'
	R
	'I feel like it was bad luck,'
	R
	'though.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Is it this flower...?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_07704:
	ZH 1:
	'Uspira was walking in front of'
	R
	'Saias and stopped at a flower'
