	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Aah... A name?'
	R
	'It’s name is...'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076e8:
	ZH 1:
	'...Thin Ice.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Well, I haven’t really decided'
	R
	'yet. You could name it, if you'
	R
	'want.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'May I...?'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_076cc:
	ZH 1:
	'Of course.'
	R
	'Well, I’ll be deploying.'
	R
	'Rest here as long as you like.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
	\L_0773c:
	ZH 1:
	'Yes... Be careful.'
	\L_077f1:
	\L_077e4:
